by somatic mutations and genomic deletions in marginal zone lymphomas. Blood 2009;113:4918&#x2013;21. 10.1182/blood-2008-08-174110</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="doi">10.1182/blood-2008-08-174110</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pmc">PMC2686142</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">19258598</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Duong BH, Onizawa M, Oses-Prieto JA et al. A20 restricts ubiquitination of pro-interleukin-1&#x3b2; protein complexes and suppresses NLRP3 inflammasome activity. Immunity 2015;42:55&#x2013;67. 10.1016/j.immuni.2014.12.031</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="doi">10.1016/j.immuni.2014.12.031</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pmc">PMC4302274</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">25607459</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Hammer GE, Turer EE, Taylor KE et al. Expression of A20 by dendritic cells preserves immune homeostasis and prevents colitis and spondyloarthritis. Nat Immunol 2011;12:1184&#x2013;93. 10.1038/ni.2135</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="doi">10.1038/ni.2135</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pmc">PMC3419270</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">22019834</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Matmati M, Jacques P, Maelfait J et al. A20 (TNFAIP3) deficiency in myeloid cells triggers erosive polyarthritis resembling rheumatoid arthritis. Nat Genet 2011;43:908&#x2013;12. 10.1038/ng.874</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="doi">10.1038/ng.874</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">21841782</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Vande Walle L, Van Opdenbosch N, Jacques P et al. Negative regulation of the NLRP3 inflammasome by A20 protects against arthritis. Nature 2014;512:69&#x2013;73. 10.1038/nature13322</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="doi">10.1038/nature13322</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pmc">PMC4126806</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">25043000</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation